---
// Experience timeline section
---

<section id="experience" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white/50 dark:bg-dark/50 backdrop-blur-sm">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal>Pengalaman & Posisi</h2>

    <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Timeline line -->
      <div class="absolute left-8 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-cyan-500"></div>

      <!-- Experience items -->
      <div data-reveal class="relative pl-20 mb-12">
        <div class="absolute left-4 top-4 w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg">
          <span class="text-sm">🏪</span>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 hover:transform hover:translate-x-2 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Store Operation</h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">Aktif</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Mengelola operasional harian store, memastikan SOP berjalan dengan baik, 
            mengoptimalkan inventory, dan memberikan pelayanan terbaik kepada customer.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal-delay="100" class="relative pl-20 mb-12">
        <div class="absolute left-4 top-4 w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-pink-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg">
          <span class="text-sm">🔧</span>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 hover:transform hover:translate-x-2 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Service Advisor</h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">Aktif</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Memberikan konsultasi teknis kepada pelanggan, melakukan diagnosa kendaraan, 
            merencanakan jadwal maintenance, dan mengelola proses servis hingga selesai.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal-delay="200" class="relative pl-20">
        <div class="absolute left-4 top-4 w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg">
          <span class="text-sm">🏭</span>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 hover:transform hover:translate-x-2 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Stamping Press Operator</h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">Aktif</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Mengoperasikan mesin stamping press dengan presisi, melakukan quality control 
            terhadap produk, menjaga standar keselamatan kerja, dan mengoptimalkan proses produksi.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
